  "Personalize Your Theme Color With the Theme Customizer module of eCommerceGo, you have full control over your stores appearance. Start by selecting a theme color that aligns with your brand identity. Whether you prefer bold and vibrant hues or subtle and calming shades, this feature allows you to choose from a wide range of colors to make your store visually appealing and unique. By customizing your theme color, you create a consistent and recognizable brand experience for your customers, enhancing their engagement and loyalty.": "Персонализируйте цвет своей темы С помощью модуля «Настройщик тем» eCommerceGo вы можете полностью контролировать внешний вид своих магазинов. ",
  "View Live Demo": "Посмотреть живую демонстрацию",
  "Define Your Border Color": "Определите цвет границы",
  "Borders play a crucial role in defining the structure and aesthetics of your stores design. The Theme Customizer module enables you to easily customize border colors to match your chosen theme and enhance the visual hierarchy of your content. This feature allows you to make specific elements stand out or blend seamlessly with the overall design, providing a polished and professional look to your store.": "Границы играют решающую роль в определении структуры и эстетики дизайна вашего магазина. ",
  "Choose Your Theme White Color": "Выберите свою тему Белый цвет",
  "For those who prefer a clean and minimalist aesthetic, the Theme Customizer module offers the option to adjust the white color used throughout your theme. This feature allows you to select the perfect shade of white that complements your store’s design, ensuring that your content is clear, readable, and visually appealing. A well-chosen white theme color can give your store a fresh, modern look that appeals to a wide audience.": "Для тех, кто предпочитает чистую и минималистскую эстетику, модуль Theme Customizer предлагает возможность настроить белый цвет, используемый во всей вашей теме. ",
  "Customize Your Button Color": "Настройте цвет кнопки",
